      <figcaption>
        <span class="panel-label">No. 7 · 1893 to 1972</span>
        <p>An 1893 amendment grouped candidates in party columns under a "Big Box": one X voted the whole party's ticket. Maine kept the Big Box until a 1972 ballot initiative repealed it.</p>
      </figcaption>
